<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 29.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 29.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing</p>
<p>rates for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Aug  29     Aug 28	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  236.460     236.650     237,040   -0.24 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  160.140     159.945     165.490   -3.23 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.734	46.690	48.410   -3.46 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  368.780     368.420     366.280    0.68 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  197.945     197.850     206.030   -3.92 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.810     142.650     147.886   -3.43 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.631	15.624	14.975    4.38 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.430     218.390     230.135   -5.09 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.130     300.900     303.640   -0.83 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.892	 1.892	 1.939   -2.42 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.560	 1.559	 1.575   -0.95 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
